Introducing The Lumby, a recto verso vertical cardholder, a perfect blend of elegance and practicality. This finely crafted piece, hand-made from high-quality veg tan leather, exudes sophistication while offering optimal functionality. It features three card slots on each side, allowing for easy organization and access to your essential cards. At the heart of the holder, you'll find a convenient cash slot. This card holder is not only a testament to exquisite craftsmanship but also a statement piece that complements any style.

Choose your leather types and colours to make it your own!

